Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 09:30:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: flee to a town guard below 20 % with 2+ attackers, when
 one is within 80 yd (F-219)

combat.kill flee_pct breaks off (reason flee); the runner offers it only near a guard
(CREATURE_FLAG_EXTRA_GUARD 0x8000) and runs to him without stopping to fight.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SQmFdwZBdZ1kNkYTTF4JNJ
